Subject: [PATCH] Use more pipeline builders during boot and drop to configured count

Shader cache compilation takes 158s out of 205s boot time when limited to 2
builder threads. Spawn up to 8 builders during boot (LoadDiskResources), and
drop back to configured EDEN_NX2_PIPELINE_WORKERS once disk resources are
loaded before gameplay begins. SCOPE_EXIT ensures the pool always drops back
even on early return or cache setup failure.

